```
Jangkaan / Expected: default + kiraan betul. Ralat biasa / Common error: `KeyError: 'umur'` bila akses terus `d[k]` — Solusi / Solution: `.get(k, default)` untuk kunci pilihan.

Melayu: Decorator balut fungsi (`@lru_cache`, `@property`); jalan masa definisi — kekal tanpa kesan samping. English: run at def-time; keep side-effect free.
```python
from functools import lru_cache
@lru_cache(maxsize=128)
def fib(n):
    return n if n < 2 else fib(n-1) + fib(n-2)
print(fib(10))  # 55
```
Jangkaan / Expected: 55 (laju). Ralat biasa / Common error: metadata hilang (`__name__`) — Solusi / Solution: `@wraps(f)` dalam decorator sendiri.

